@startuml
actor "NETWORK OPERATOR" as Net_OP
participant "MGM Cluster" as MGM
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


hide footbox
hide unlinked 

Net_OP -> Net_OP:Create an MGM GroupPolicy.json
Net_OP -> Net_OP: Package MGM GroupPolicy.json file\n into an MGM CPI
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: **DF_XXX**\n \
            Upload the CPI to your cluster
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: return CPI ID
deactivate MGM

|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: CPI get status API
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: cpiFileChecksum
deactivate MGM
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Create a virtual node in your cluster for the MGM(cpiFileChecksum, x500Name)
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: return: holding identity ID
deactivate MGM
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Assign required HSMs for the MGM 
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: SESSION KEY ID
deactivate MGM
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Create required keys, and optionally import required certificates
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: ECDH KEY ID
deactivate MGM
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Use the register endpoint to finalise the MGM setup so that it is ready to accept members
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP:  
deactivate MGM
|||
Net_OP ->  Net_OP: Build registration context
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Register MGM membership/$MGM_HOLDING_ID(action=requestJoin, REGISTRATION_CONTEXT)
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: return SUBMITTED
deactivate MGM 
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: Configure P2P TLS cert(SESSION KEY ID)
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: return
deactivate MGM 
|||
Net_OP ->  MGM: export group policy for group 
activate MGM 
MGM --> Net_OP: return GroupPolicy.json
deactivate MGM 
@enduml